WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:01.323
Now, how do you feel

00:00:01.323 --> 00:00:05.096
about the first live
birth that's podcasted?

00:00:05.096 --> 00:00:07.410
Oh.
(laughing)

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:08.840
I think that's something
we should talk about.

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.940
Look, I see, think of it, look,

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.626
think of the clicks,
think of the merchandise.

00:00:13.626 --> 00:00:15.010
Merchandise?

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.300
Yeah, you know, we shoot video

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.360
for all these things now, too.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.840
That's what the ring light's for.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.240
Yeah, no audio, no audio only,

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:22.700
But just, you know us.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:23.807
And then (imitates baby crying)!

00:00:25.987 --> 00:00:28.320
(all laugh)

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:32.490
Oh, man!

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.861
In the background we can hear
Tak breaking boards. Crack!

00:00:35.861 --> 00:00:38.270
(both laugh)
Crack! Crack!

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:40.440
He's doing karate in the room?

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.573
Yeah, yeah!

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:44.510
Umbilical cord?

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:46.452
I got this! Whack!

00:00:46.452 --> 00:00:48.200
He takes out a throwing star

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.348
and just cuts the umbilical cord.

00:00:50.348 --> 00:00:52.250
(Conan imitates a throwing
star whizzing through the air)

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.787
Oh my God.

